  "id": "data-driven-processing",
  "term": "data-driven processing",
  "definition": "Data-driven processing is an analysis approach that does not start with a pre-set prediction about the expected response pattern. Instead, it looks for patterns that emerge from the data itself, which can reveal activity missed by predictor-based methods.",
